+    改回直接塞原值時會紅。判準來源:掛鉤逾時與鎖那兩行原本連 _clean_field 都沒過。"""
+    src = (Path(GRAPHCTL).resolve().parent / "hooks" / "claude" / "dispatch-lens-hook.py").read_text(encoding="utf-8")
